TASK-212 runtime harness: the visible strings after the rename of Air
Traffic Control to Link Routes. Temporary code, never committed to Detour/.
Gated on DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR; DETOUR_VERIFY_APPEARANCE light or dark. Data dir
DetourVerify2120; seeds two routes once (Domain is work.example, Contains
docs, both to Home). Logs every main-menu item title, then waits for 12 s of
HID idle, shows Settings and walks every toolbar pane, logging each pane's
visible text fields, button titles, pop-up item titles and paneDescription,
counting any that contain "air traffic" and echoing those that mention Link
Routes or the Links pane. SHOOT lines for the Links and Quick Detour panes.
run.sh is TASK-213's with the data dir changed and the fixture/extension
variables dropped (SHOOT lines served with screencapture -l, only the
launched PID killed).

    git apply docs/harness/task212-harness.patch && xcodegen generate
    xcodebuild -scheme Detour -configuration Debug build -derivedDataPath .derived
    run.sh light; run.sh dark

